      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹35.80 (up from ₹0.54 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹46.4b (up 3.4% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.48b (up ₹2.44b from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.3% (up from 0.1% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was primarily driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, the company's share price growth rate has exceeded its earnings growth rate by 62 percentage points per year, which is a significant difference in performance.",
