      "title": "Dividend increased to ₹4.00",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹4.00 is 33% higher than last year. Ex-date: 17th September 2026 Payment date: 24th October 2026 Dividend yield will be 2.8%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.8%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is not covered by earnings (dividend approximately 5x earnings). However, it is well covered by cash flows (13% cash payout ratio). The dividend has decreased over the past 10 years, indicating a lack of growth and stability in payments. The company's earnings per share (EPS) would need to grow by 519% to bring the payout ratio under control, which is more than the 9.1% EPS growth achieved over the last 5 years.",
